diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4d0054e..ce5ce77 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -5,13 +5,15 @@ Parse and format compact durations. Zero dependencies, published on npm.
 ```js
 const { parse, format } = require("tiny-duration");
 
+parse("2d4h"); // 187200000
 parse("1h30m"); // 5400000
+format(93600000); // "1d 2h"
 format(5400000); // "1h 30m"
 ```
 
 ## API
 
-- `parse(text)`: milliseconds from a duration made of `h`, `m`, `s` and `ms`
+- `parse(text)`: milliseconds from a duration made of `d`, `h`, `m`, `s` and `ms`
   parts. Throws `TypeError` on empty input and `SyntaxError` on anything else
   it cannot read.
 - `format(ms)`: the largest units first, separated by spaces. `0` is `"0s"`.
